##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene Three overlapping named spheres of two materials on a floor under a dome, with Cryptomatte layers of their objects and their materials
version 3.03
Format 48 32 1
PixelSamples 4 4
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -20 1 0 0
Display "compositing-crypto.exr" "openexr" "rgba"
SampleFilter "PxrCryptomatte" "objects" "string filename" ["compositing-crypto-objects.exr"] "string layer" ["Name"]
SampleFilter "PxrCryptomatte" "materials" "string filename" ["compositing-crypto-materials.exr"] "string layer" ["Material"]
WorldBegin
Light "PxrDomeLight" "sky"
Attribute "identifier" "name" ["floor"]
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "floor" "color base_color" [0.6 0.6 0.6] "float specular_roughness" [0.4]
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 -2  2 -1 -2  2 -1 2  -2 -1 2]
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 2  2 -1 2  2 1.5 2  -2 1.5 2]
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "red" "color base_color" [0.8 0.15 0.1]
AttributeBegin
Attribute "identifier" "name" ["left"]
Translate -0.45 -0.5 0
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
Attribute "identifier" "name" ["right"]
Translate 0.45 -0.5 0
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
Attribute "identifier" "name" ["front"]
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "blue" "color base_color" [0.1 0.2 0.8]
Translate 0 -0.7 -0.6
Sphere 0.3 -0.3 0.3 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
